# Six non-dyadic samples into each of SeriesBackendWelfordEwma,
# SeriesBackendRingBuffer and SeriesBackendReservoir, one pump each. The
# rules read before the pump's samples are taken ([LSER.8.6]): pump 1 is
# cold, pump 6 reads five. `Moments`' payload slots reach the recording
# comparison, where a last-bit difference is a wrong double. Each step
# changes the value, so every assert is a sample ([LFAC.2.5.1]).
# @spec [LSER.16.3.3]
assert Acc k=a v=0.1
assert Win k=a v=0.1
assert Bag k=a v=0.1
pump
assert Acc k=a v=0.7
assert Win k=a v=0.7
assert Bag k=a v=0.7
pump
assert Acc k=a v=0.2
assert Win k=a v=0.2
assert Bag k=a v=0.2
pump
assert Acc k=a v=1.3
assert Win k=a v=1.3
assert Bag k=a v=1.3
pump
assert Acc k=a v=2.9
assert Win k=a v=2.9
assert Bag k=a v=2.9
pump
assert Acc k=a v=0.3
assert Win k=a v=0.3
assert Bag k=a v=0.3
pump
